# LOCAL TEST ONLY (LIME-140, moved here by LIME-153). The mesh routing key pair of the LOCAL stack, so `mesh-drop` can be tested here.
# It is public on purpose (it is in the repo and in the tests) and it is NOT the staging key: the staging secret is made by
# `supabase/mesh-keygen.sh` and goes straight into Supabase's secrets. This file is read only by the local Edge runtime (`supabase start`,
# `supabase functions serve`); nothing deploys it. `deploy-staging.sh` refuses a staging that holds this key.
MESH_ROUTING_SECRET_KEY=KILKJyNyeB2broEOGIiyuqZcUVWs9jZM9XtAjY/ZiWA=

